  "_about": "THE EUROPEAN POLECAT (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/carn/polecat.py): built from the least weasel (its rig and sculpt) at 2.0 and reshaped -- the trunk 20% thicker and arched over the loin, stouter legs; a broader, blunter head (cranium and cheeks widened, the muzzle shortened to .92), small round white-rimmed ears; a 14 cm dark, slightly bushy tail (one sweep); dark brown with the creamy underfur showing low on the flanks (paints), near-black legs, chest and tail; the bandit face: a dark mask across the eyes and bridge on a pale face, white muzzle, chin, cheek patches and a white band across the brow (paints). The weasel's own coat pattern (fixed to its size) is replaced by agouti fur and paints. Written whole by its script.",
